Z||000000||AusFiero||12-23-2001||06:49 AM||||God I must be bored. To the tune of Jingle Bells.<P>Dashing through the snow, in a t-topped Fiero. <BR>The NOS is leaking bad, we're laughing all the way.<BR>Stereo booming loudly, making children cry.<BR>Oh what fun it is to sing a Fiero song tonight. <P>Oh, Fiero bells, Fiero bells WTF are they?<BR>Something that santa put underneath the sleigh. <BR>Oh Fiero bells, Fiero Bells.<BR>Who am I to say.<BR>But Fieros realy rock and santa has a sleigh, HA. <P>A day or two ago,<BR>I thought I'd take a ride,<BR>And soon Miss Fanny Bright<BR>Was seated by my side;<BR>The car was clean this night<BR>Misfortune seemed my lot<BR>I got into a drift. <BR>And hit a real big rock.<P>Oh, Fiero bells, Fiero bells WTF are they?<BR>Something that santa put underneath the sleigh. <BR>Oh Fiero bells, Fiero Bells.<BR>Who am I to say.<BR>But Fieros realy rock and santa has a sleigh, HA. <P>A day or two ago,<BR>The story I must tell<BR>I went out on the snow<BR>And layed rubber like hell<BR>A babe was driving by<BR>In a V8 Fiero<BR>She laughed at me<BR>For trying hard<BR>But quickly drove away.<P>Now the car is white<BR>Go it while you're young,<BR>Take the girls tonight<BR>And sing this Fiero song;<BR>get a bob-tail off e-bay<BR>go 100 as your speed<BR>Hitch him to an old Mustang<BR>And shake the thing to bits.<P>Oh, Fiero bells, Fiero bells WTF are they?<BR>Something that santa put underneath the sleigh. <BR>Oh Fiero bells, Fiero Bells.<BR>Who am I to say.<BR>But Fieros realy rock and santa has a sleigh, HA.<P><BR>Man really bored I must be  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <BR><P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/auschristmas.gif">        <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||6
